### Test Circle Topic Post Endpoints
### These tests verify the circle topic post feature

### 1. Get topic post for a circle (should return 404 if no topic exists)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/circles/697714f67ca9366f6ef2f784/topic
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Set a post as circle topic (requires authentication)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/circles/697714f67ca9366f6ef2f784/topic/POST_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Get topic post after setting (should return 200 with post data)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/circles/697714f67ca9366f6ef2f784/topic
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Remove topic post (requires authentication - circle creator only)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/circles/697714f67ca9366f6ef2f784/topic
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. Get topic post after removal (should return 404)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/circles/697714f67ca9366f6ef2f784/topic
Content-Type: application/json
